is a genius or anything.
-No, no.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:27.887 line:92%
I decided to take an eye tes

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:31.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I didn't read --
read properly.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:35.528
No, and, yeah, we had to wrestle
