00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you found that
working together?

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.575
-I'd say we're probably quit
different, aren't we, Brian?

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:52.011
Yeah, I've always, kind of
admired the way that Brian works

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:55.115
and the way he's been kind o
able to access characters.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.618
So, you know, I tried to kind of
pick up some tips along the way.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.520 line:92%
There was one scene where we -

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
His character in the show
has lost his mother.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:03.990 line:92%
He's drugged her up at home,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:04.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
