to be responsible,

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
so she'll stay in bed whil
he goes and does the shopping.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when he gets back,
she's gone.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:09.496 line:92%
He doesn't know where she is

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:10.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he's really worried
about her.

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:13.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
