running in somewhere

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.134 size:75% position:38% line:92%
to find where she --

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:16.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, where she'd gone to,
and he's worried,

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:17.937 line:92%
