I was like, "This is amazing."

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I listened,
and he was saying,

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That time I lost Dipper
on the beach.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
That time I lost Dipper
on the beach."

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:33.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was remembering a time
he lost our dog."

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.420 line:92%
Which, I mean, blew my mind.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, that's deeper than
I think I've ever --

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:39.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
