I'm a student of Stanislavski.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:51.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, sense memory,
emotional recall.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.006 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But I did lose the dog

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:55.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I took him out for a walk
