and just had a meltdown,

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:10.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I went home
to confess to mom and dad.

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:13.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I really had to tune mysel
up 'cause I got to confess

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:17.931
And I went into the kitchen,
and mom was there, and I said,

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:20.333 line:92%
