"I've lost Dipper, the dog."

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:25.905 line:92%
And she said, "No, you didn't.

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:27.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's right there
under the kitchen table."

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So he had at some point

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:32.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
