00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:35.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't like this anymore.
I'm heading home."

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.683 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:38.151 line:92%
-My worry is that you never --

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:39.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you left
with an empty lead.

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
My worry is you left that hous
with a lead

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
