They'll edit all this out.
And then by the end of it,

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.488
you finally got it right..
-No, I'm gonna leave it in

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:17.757
-...and then you tripped up --
then you tripped up on "Breean,"

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:20.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
